<title>ARGENTINA: Argentine markets closed for holiday.</title>
<headline>Argentine markets closed for holiday.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Argentine financial and grain markets were closed Monday for a national holiday marking the death of national independence hero Gen. Jose de San Martin.</p>
<p>Markets will return to work as usual Tuesday.</p>
<p>((--Buenos Aires Newsroom +541 318-0655))</p>
</text>
